<title>UK: RTZ holds steady as Kleinwort lifts estimate.</title>
<headline>RTZ holds steady as Kleinwort lifts estimate.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in RTZ Corp Plc held steady in a declining London market on Monday as analysts at Dresdner Kleinwort Benson raised their earnings forcasts and repeated a &quot;buy&quot; rating on the stock, dealers said.</p>
<p>RTZ shares were up 1/2p at 946 by 1146 GMT in volume of 802,261 shares. The FTSE 100 index was down 24.3 points at 4,230.6.</p>
</text>
